message: "If you use Protologue, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Protologue: A Taxonomy of Prompting and LLM Techniques"
authors:
  - name: "Protologue"
    website: "https://protologue.com/"
version: "1.2.0"
date-released: "2026-10-11"
license: CC-BY-4.0
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23304106"
url: "https://protologue.com/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/protologue-org/protologue"
abstract: >-
  An openly licensed, sourced reference for the vocabulary of prompting
  and large language model techniques. Each entry has a permanent
  identifier, a standalone definition, synonyms, broader, narrower and
  related links, and the primary source that introduced the technique.
keywords:
  - prompt engineering
  - large language models
  - taxonomy
  - glossary
  - SKOS
